Our hosting partner, OuraneCloud, provides SecNumCloud qualification at the hosting layer, supporting sovereign hosting of confidential data within the EU. This setup ensures that we meet the client's demands for strict respect of professional secrecy, GDPR compliance, and a non-decisional assistance tool while maintaining the reliability, traceability, and explainability of outputs.
